# the screen reader (fm1-reader, announce.c): each page, knob and help card is said once, in the screen's words; the
# journal's new lines are said as they are written
wait 200
listen
wait 100
said Window page: Snowfields, at Old Harbour
tap ENV
wait 300
said Passengers page: Ines aboard
tap GLO
wait 300
said Setup page: Tune 0, MIDI out Off, Lights On
spin K2 1
wait 300
said MIDI out On
tap SEQ
wait 300
said Journal page: entry 1 of
tap HOME
wait 300
said Window page
spin K1 1
wait 300
said Stretch 8 min
wait 40000
said boards at
press SAVE
wait 1000
said SAVE button. SAVES THE JOURNEY
release SAVE
tap SAVE
said SAVED
tap PLAY
said THE TRAIN STANDS
tap PLAY
said THE TRAIN RUNS
